.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2065:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/019-skill-doc-alignment-and-changelog-consolidation/implementation-summary.md:51:The deep-agent-improvement skill's docs now tell the truth about what packet 121 built. The changelog is one comprehensive v1.9.0.0 entry covering the whole program, and the README presents the skill as the two-lane tool it became instead of the pre-121 single-lane one.
