.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2373:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/015-fix-deep-review-findings-for-two-lane-code/decision-record.md:552:| P2 maintainability-4-3 | P2 | Unknown modes collapse into Lane A | FIXED | Validate record.mode; unknown bucket or infra warning |
