.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2672:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/013-scripts-physical-reorg/spec.md:40:This phase moves the 16 deep-agent-improvement scripts plus the scorer subtree into agent-improvement, model-benchmark, and shared lane subdirs, making the two-lane split visible on disk for the last flat surface. It is the highest-risk phase because two path traps lie in wait: loop-host spawns children across all three lanes (TST-1 must stay byte-identical) and dispatch-model resolves config by walking up from `__dirname` (a wrong depth fails silently).
.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2673:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/013-scripts-physical-reorg/spec.md:42:**Key Decisions**: three-lane classification (ADR-001), spawn-time lane resolution to preserve TST-1 (ADR-002), fix dispatch-model depth plus a positive config-load test (ADR-003), lib and tests stay at root (ADR-004)
