000000000000000000000000000000000\\\"\\n22:       session_id: \\\"scaffold-scaffold/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode\\\"\\n23:       parent_session_id: null\\n24:     completion_pct: 0\\n25:     op... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1780128167552,\"sessionID\":\"ses_18818249cffeInllmWUcVkPFl1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_function_0547od48jedk_3\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/deep-agent-improvement/references/model-benchmark/evaluator_contract.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/deep-agent-improvement/references/model-benchmark/evaluator_contract.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: title: Evaluator Contract\\n3: description: Deterministic scoring and benchmark contract for target-profiled deep-agent-improvement experiments.\\n4: ---\\n5: \\n6: # Evaluator Contract\\n7: \\n8: Contract for how `deep-agent-improvement` scores candidates and benchmarks packet-local outputs. Use it when you need the exact evaluator inputs, outputs, rubric dimensions, and hard rejection behavior.\\n9: \\n10: ---\\n11: \\n12: ## 1. OVERVIEW\\n13: \\n14: ### Purpose\\n15: \\n16: Defines the input and output contract for the prompt-surface scorer and the output benchmark runner so deep-agent-improvement runs remain deterministic enough for bounded local experimentation.\\n17: \\n18: ### When to Use\\n19: \\n20: Use this reference when:\\n21: - Updating scoring logic or benchmark rules\\n22: - Explaining why a candidate was kept, rejected, or marked infra-failure\\n23: - Adding a new target profile that needs evaluator support\\n24: \\n25: ### Core Principle\\n26: \\n27: Weak candidates and infrastructure failures must be distinguishable. The contract exists so a broken tool path is not mistaken for a bad prompt and vice versa.\\n28: \\n29: ---\\n30: \\n31: ## 2. EVALUATED SURFACES\\n32: \\n33: ### Dynamic Profiles (only mode)\\n34: \\n35: Every agent file in `.opencode/agents/*.md` is evaluated using dynamic mode. The scorer generates a profile on the fly from the agent's own structure, rules, and permissions using `ge... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1780128167578,\"sessionID\":\"ses_18818249cffeInllmWUcVkPFl1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_function_0547od48jedk_2\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\".opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/**\"},\"output\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/minimax/logs/iter-001.out\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/deepseek/logs/iter-001.out\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/orchestration-status.log\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/jobs.txt\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/run_one.sh\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/logs/iter-00