+| Self-RAG / RAGAS | adaptive retrieval, context precision/recall/utilization | [deepseek/iter1] [gpt55/iter1] [SOURCE: https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11511] [SOURCE: https://docs.ragas.io/en/v0.1.21/concepts/metrics/index.html] |
