+- DeepSeek contributed the most detailed verified RQ1/RQ2 external prior-art mapping and a practical instrumentation ladder: CLI parse, tool proxy, MCP intercept [deepseek/iter1] [deepseek/iter2].
+- GPT-5.5 contributed the most implementation-shaped synthesis: public/private fixture schema, sealed workspace, trace artifacts, remediation rows, and a concrete rename surface from repo search [gpt55/iter1] [gpt55/iter2]. Its iteration 3 log indicates an RQ3/RQ4 run was attempted, but no `gpt55/iterations/iteration-003.md` exists in the available markdown corpus.
