+| Toolformer | tool/API call annotation and usefulness filtering | [deepseek/iter2] [SOURCE: https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.04761] |
+| Self-RAG / RAGAS | adaptive retrieval, context precision/recall/utilization | [deepseek/iter1] [gpt55/iter1] [SOURCE: https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11511] [SOURCE: https://docs.ragas.io/en/v0.1.21/concepts/metrics/index.html] |
+| LangSmith eval concepts | trace/trajectory and pairwise/reference evaluators | [gpt55/iter1] [SOURCE: https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/evaluation-concepts?mode=ui] |
+| OpenAI evals / tracing / OpenTelemetry | schema-backed eval records and span/event traces | [gpt55/iter2] [SOURCE: https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/evals] [SOURCE: https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-python/tracing/] [SOURCE: https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/trace/api/] |
