-.opencode/commands/deep/start-agent-improvement-loop.md:498:- **CRITIC PASS verbatim emission** (post-060/006): `@deep-agent-improvement` body now mandates the 6 challenge labels appear verbatim in candidate JSON `critic_pass` field. Reviewers and stress tests grep for the exact strings.
-.opencode/commands/deep/start-agent-improvement-loop.md:504:This command is the **Lane A** (agent-improvement) entry point. The underlying `deep-agent-improvement` skill ALSO supports a separate **model-benchmark** mode (Lane B) that benchmarks a model or prompt framework instead of mutating an agent file. It shares the candidate, dispatcher, and scorer seams with the agent-improvement path.
