-.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2466:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/002-implementation-deep-research/research/deep-research-config.json:2:  "topic": "How should we implement the deep-agent-improvement model-benchmark mode designed in 001? Define exact interface contracts for the three pluggable seams (candidate-source, dispatcher, scorer); how to generalize the 120/003 dispatch-minimax.cjs into a model-agnostic dispatch-model.cjs; how to port the 120/003 eval-rig scorer + 5-dim rubric cleanly into deep-agent-improvement; how to wire a mode switch (agent-improvement | model-benchmark) into loop.cjs without regressing the agent-improvement path; the backward-compat test strategy; and implementation edge cases/pitfalls. Output build-ready guidance: per-seam interface contracts plus a wiring + backward-compat plan as a build-delta list.",
-.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2467:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/002-implementation-deep-research/research/deep-research-config.json:10:  "specFolder": ".opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/002-implementation-deep-research",
