-.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2543:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/001-mode-selector-design/spec.md:152:| Risk | Over-generalizing a focused skill (wrong abstraction) | Med | Keep scorers/promotion mode-separate; share only the proven-generic plumbing; mode default preserves current behavior |
-.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/122-deep-improvement-skill-benchmark-mode/001-skill-benchmark-deep-research/research/gpt55/logs/iter-001.out:2544:.opencode/specs/skilled-agent-orchestration/121-deep-agent-improvement-benchmark-mode/001-mode-selector-design/spec.md:163:- **NFR-P01**: Model-benchmark runs are bounded by a dispatch budget cap (like 120/003's ~60 calls); the loop is resumable (append-only state) so it survives interruption.
